@host = http://localhost:5021
# 1) Run "Login" (or "Register"), then paste the token here:
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "player1", "password": "secret123" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "player1", "password": "secret123" }

### All games
GET {{host}}/api/games

### Characters: page 1, 5 per page
GET {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters?page=1&pageSize=5

### Characters: filter by game + role
GET {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters?game=zelda&role=hero

### Characters: search by name
GET {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters?search=cloud

### One character
GET {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters/1

### Create a character (needs token)
POST {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luigi",
  "role": "Hero",
  "description": "Mario's younger brother.",
  "level": 45,
  "gameId": 1
}

### Validation error example (empty name -> 400)
POST {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "role": "Hero", "gameId": 1 }

### Update a character (needs token)
PUT {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mario", "role": "Hero", "level": 55, "gameId": 1 }

### Delete a character (needs token)
DELETE {{host}}/api/videogamecharacters/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a game (needs token)
POST {{host}}/api/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hollow Knight", "genre": "Metroidvania", "releaseYear": 2017 }
